  "title": "No-Knead Cinnamon Rolls",
  "description": "No-knead cinnamon rolls are easy since your bread machine does all the mixing. That leaves you with the fun stuff: rolling, assembling, baking, and eating!",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie Knewasser"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-08-28T09:11:49-04:00",
